Variables\">We\u2019re here for you</h2>\n               \n               <p xmlns:ouc=\"http://omniupdate.com/XSL/Variables\">The primary mission of the AAMU's Office of Student Financial Aid &amp; Scholarships is\n                  to make a quality education both possible and affordable. We realize that a college\n                  education will be one of the most important investments a student and family will\n                  make. We do also realize that the financial aid process can sometimes be a daunting\n                  endeavor. Our goal is to provide our students and parents with the necessary information\n                  and guidance needed to make this process as simple and as manageable as possible.</p>\n               \n               <div class=\"contact-info contact-info-rows block\" id=\"contactus\">\n                  <div class=\"content grid-x fullwidth\">\n                     <div class=\"entry-block cell medium-6\">\n                        <div class=\"wrapper\">\n                           <div vocab=\"https://schema.org/\" typeof=\"Organization\">\n                              <div property=\"name\" class=\"h4 name\">Office of Student Financial Aid and Scholarships</div>\n                              <div property=\"email\"><span class=\"fas fa-envelope\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a href=\"mailto:financialaid@aamu.edu\"> financialaid@aamu.edu</a></div>\n                              <div property=\"telephone\"><span class=\"fas fa-phone\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> 256.372.5400</div>\n                              <div property=\"faxNumber\"><span class=\"fas fa-fax\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> 256.372.5407</div>\n                              <div property=\"address\" typeof=\"PostalAddress\"><span class=\"fas fa-building\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span property=\"streetAddress\"> Patton Hall, Room 211</span></div>\n                              <div property=\"address\" typeof=\"PostalAddress\"><span class=\"fas fa-mail-bulk\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span property=\"streetAddress\">Mailing Address:</span><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n                                 \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t P.O. Box <span property=\"postOfficeBoxNumber\">907</span><br><span property=\"addressLocality\" style=\"padding-left:27px;\">Normal</span>,&nbsp;\n                                 \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span property=\"addressRegion\">AL</span>&nbsp;\n                                 \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span property=\"postalCode\">35762</span></div><span class=\"fas fa-ticket-alt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a href=\"https://kiosk.na4.qless.com/kiosk/app/home/50\">Join the Financial Aid Virtual Line</a></div>\n                        </div>\n                     </div>\n                     <div class=\"entries-block cell medium-6\">\n                        <div class=\"wrapper\">\n                           <td xmlns:ouc=\"http://omniupdate.com/XSL/Variables\" data-table-separator-options=\"clone empty\">&nbsp;</td>\n                        </div>\n                     </div>\n                  </div>\n               </div>\n               <div class=\"callout tan-callout\">\n                  <p>In order to view PDF files on your computer, you must have a PDF reader program installed.\n                     If you do not already have such a reader, you can download a free reader at Adobe's\n                     website: <a href=\"https://get.adobe.com/reader/\">Download Adobe Acrobat Reader Software <span class=\"fa fa-file-pdf\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></a></p>\n               </div>\n               <div class=\"cta fullwidth\"><img alt=\"Overhead view of campus\" src=\"/_images/_examples/main-cta-md.png\" srcset=\"/_images/_examples/main-cta-sm.png 320w,/_images/_examples/main-cta-md.png 700w,/_images/_examples/main-cta-lg.png 1280w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><div class=\"content\">\n                     <h2 class=\"title\">Lead the way</h2>\n                     <div class=\"wrap\">\n   